        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 2(3)(a) it exhibits a complete and certified copy of the foreign judgment (including the reasons, if any, for the decision)` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows (O 3 r 2(4), outside this range, lists what the Court may do)
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 2(3)(b) it exhibits the exclusive choice of court agreement, a certified copy of it or any other evidence of its existence` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows
        IF `the foreign judgment was given by default` AND (NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 2(3)(c) it exhibits the original or a certified copy of a document showing that the party in default was notified of the document by which the proceedings were instituted or an equivalent document`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows; owed only where `the foreign judgment was given by default`
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 2(3)(d)(i) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish that the foreign judgment has effect in the State of origin` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows
        IF `the foreign judgment or part is to be enforced` AND (NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 2(3)(d)(ii) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish that the judgment or that part is enforceable in the State of origin`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows; owed only where `the foreign judgment or part is to be enforced`
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 2(3)(d)(iii) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish any matter mentioned in paragraph (2)(a) and (d) to (i)` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows
