`o 37 r 3(2) the supporting affidavit states what the paragraph requires` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2) it states the matters to the best of the information or belief of the deponent` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2) is a bare "must state, to the best of the information or belief of the deponent"; the text does not say what follows (O 3 r 2(4), outside this range, lists what the Court may do)
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(a) it states that the contract is a judicial settlement within the meaning of section 2(1)` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(a) is a bare "must state"; the text does not say what follows
        IF (NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(b)(i) it states that the judicial settlement was approved by a chosen court designated in an exclusive choice of court agreement between the parties`) AND (NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(b)(ii) it states that the judicial settlement was concluded before the chosen court in the course of proceedings before that court`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(b) is a bare "either of the following"; the text does not say what follows if neither is stated
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(c) it states that the judicial settlement, or the part, is enforceable in the same manner and to the same extent as a judgment in the State of origin` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(c) is a bare "must state"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(d) it states that the exclusive choice of court agreement was concluded in a civil or commercial matter` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(d) is a bare "must state"; the text does not say what follows
        IF (NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(e)(i) it states that at the date of the application the judicial settlement, or the part, has not been satisfied`) AND (NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(e)(ii) it states the amount in respect of which, at the date of the application, the judicial settlement, or the part, remains unsatisfied`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(e) is a bare "either of the following"; the text does not say what follows if neither is stated
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(f) it states that the judicial settlement does not relate to a matter mentioned in section 9 or 10` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(f) is a bare "must state"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(g) it states that there are no circumstances mentioned in section 20(3) in which the Court must refuse to enforce` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(g) is a bare "must state"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(h) it states whether there are any circumstances mentioned in section 20(4) in which the Court may refuse to enforce` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(h) is a bare "must state"; the text does not say what follows
        IF `there are circumstances in which the Court may refuse to enforce the judicial settlement` AND (NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(2)(i) it states each reason why the Court should nevertheless enforce the judicial settlement`) THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (2)(i) is a bare "must state"; owed only where there are circumstances in which the Court may refuse
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

DECLARE `o 37 r 3(3) documents exhibited to the supporting affidavit` HAS
    `o 37 r 3(3)(a) it exhibits a complete and certified copy of the judicial settlement` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 37 r 3(3)(b) it exhibits the exclusive choice of court agreement, a certified copy of it or any other evidence of its existence` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 37 r 3(3)(c) it exhibits a certificate of a court of the State of origin that the judicial settlement, or the part, is enforceable in the same manner and to the same extent as a judgment in the State of origin` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 37 r 3(3)(d)(i) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish that the judicial settlement, or the part, is enforceable in the State of origin` IS A BOOLEAN
    `o 37 r 3(3)(d)(ii) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish any matter mentioned in paragraph (2)(a) and (d) to (i)` IS A BOOLEAN

