        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(3)(b) it exhibits the exclusive choice of court agreement, a certified copy of it or any other evidence of its existence` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(3)(c) it exhibits a certificate of a court of the State of origin that the judicial settlement, or the part, is enforceable in the same manner and to the same extent as a judgment in the State of origin` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(3)(d)(i) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish that the judicial settlement, or the part, is enforceable in the State of origin` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows
        IF NOT affidavit's `o 37 r 3(3)(d)(ii) it exhibits any other documents necessary to establish any matter mentioned in paragraph (2)(a) and (d) to (i)` THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (silent): paragraph (3) is a bare "must exhibit the following documents"; the text does not say what follows
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE
